{
 "esm": "2.0.0",
 "metadata": {
 "name": "cam_zm",
 "description": "CAM6 ZM deep convection subassembly (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the Zhang-McFarlane chain of convect_deep.ZM (zm_conv_intr.zm_conv_tend, tphysbc site 3) mounted by reference from the four stage-2 components - Parcel (./cam_zm_parcel.esm, buoyan_dilute of zm_convr.F90:800-1513), Closure (./cam_zm_closure.esm, closure of zm_convr.F90:2340-2503), Q1Q2 (./cam_zm_q1q2.esm, q1q2_pjr of zm_convr.F90:2530-2630) and Evap (./cam_zm_evap.esm, zm_conv_evap_run of zm_conv_evap.F90:118-236) - wired by the driver couplings of zm_convr_run / zm_conv_tend only (no component law is restated). The Control model carries the couplings the driver performs between the four calls: the parcel CAPE (and the lel/tp/qstp/maxi index-and-parcel-state renames) into the closure, the closure mass flux scaling the NORMALIZED cldprp fluxes into the q1q2 mb-scaled fluxes (zm_convr.F90:725-735: mu/md/mc x mb, du x mb), the q1q2 tendencies into the precipitation rate prec = max(0, -integral over pdel of (dqdt + dlf)) rgrav/1000 (the column water-vapor-minus-detrained-cloudwater budget of zm_convr.F90:770-779, written as an integral over the layer pressure measure), and the physics_update state advance t1 = t + delt dsdt, q1 = q + delt dqdt (zm_conv_intr.F90:640, the state1 passed to zm_conv_evap_run at F90:671) into the evap - the t1/q1 law is the shared physics_update_step template of cam_templates.esm, and delt/grav/density_fresh_water are wired from the Evap component's deltat/gravit/density_fresh_water (one source of each constant). The environment gathers are also edges: the single-column identity gather of zm_convr.F90:583-585 carries Parcel.T/q/p/pf_lo/pf_hi into the closure's tg/qg/pg/pf_lo/pf_hi, and the evap's layer pmid = 100 p comes from the parcel working pressure through the named hpa_to_pa = 100 Pa/hPa constant (the inverse of p = 0.01 pmid, zm_convr.F90:518). What the four components do not produce stays boundary: the parcel-ascent solve outputs (tp/qstp/qtot of the ientropy solve, carried as parameters by the Parcel component), the level indices (msg/lcl/tl/jt from the dump), the cldprp outputs (the gathered sg, the plume states qu/su/qd/sd/qhat/shat/ql, the normalized fluxes mu/md/mc/du, cme/qcde, rprd), and the evap recurrence boundary (flxprec_lo/flxsnow_lo/evpvint, whose top-down flux integral is rejected by the CLI as an observed cycle - see README.md); these enter as parameters pinned from cam_zm.csv / cam_zm_scal.csv. Tests are end-to-end pins of the coupled chain (parcel cape -> closure mb -> q1q2 dqdt/dsdt/dlf -> prec -> evap tend_s/tend_q/prec_evap) at steps 19, 40 and 48 with ONLY boundary inputs overridden - no component output is overridden, so every pin can fail.",
 "license": "MIT",
 "tags": [
  "eqesm:stage2",
  "model:atmosphere",
  "physics:deep-convection"
 ],
 "created": "2026-11-24T00:00:00Z",
 "authors": [
  "EqESM project contributors"
 ],
 "references": [
  {
   "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CESM: CAM6 physics sources of the instrumented cam6_4_212 fork (components/cam/src/) - zm_convr.F90, zm_conv_intr.F90, zm_conv_evap.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
   "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CESM"
  },
  {
   "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
   "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
  }
 ]
},
 "index_sets": {
  "lev": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": 32
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "Parcel": {
   "ref": "./cam_zm_parcel.esm"
  },
  "Closure": {
   "ref": "./cam_zm_closure.esm"
  },
  "Q1Q2": {
   "ref": "./cam_zm_q1q2.esm"
  },
  "Evap": {
   "ref": "./cam_zm_evap.esm"
  },
  "Control": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/column_nonuniform_1d/rules/integral_lev_whole.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NLEV": 32
     }
    },
    {
     "ref": "./cam_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "t0": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "environment temperature t at level k, the zm_convr boundary state of zm_convr_run (the same field the Parcel component receives; wired from Parcel.T by the coupling), [K]; dump column t"
    },
    "q": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "environment specific humidity q at level k, the zm_convr boundary state (wired from Parcel.q), [kg/kg]; dump column q"
    },
    "pdel": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "layer pressure thickness pdel at level k, the dpp of the prec budget loop (wired from Closure.pdel), [Pa]; dump column pdel"
    },
    "dqdt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/(kg*s)",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "moisture tendency of q1q2_pjr (wired from Q1Q2.dqdt), [kg/kg/s]; dump column dqdt"
    },
    "dsdt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "K/s",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "heating tendency of q1q2_pjr (wired from Q1Q2.dsdt), [K/s]; dump column dsdt"
    },
    "dlf": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/(kg*s)",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "detrained-condensate tendency of q1q2_pjr (wired from Q1Q2.dlf), [kg/kg/s]; dump column dlf"
    },
    "delt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "physics timestep delt = ztodt, the update step of physics_update (zm_conv_intr.F90:640) and the prec budget (zm_convr.F90:776); dump constant ztodt, wired from the Evap component's deltat (the single source of the constant)"
    },
    "grav": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s^2",
     "description": "gravitational acceleration grav = SHR_CONST_G, the rgrav of the prec conversion (zm_convr.F90:779); dump constant grav, wired from the Evap component's gravit (the single source of the constant)"
    },
    "hpa_to_pa": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "Pa/hPa",
     "default": 100.0,
     "description": "hectopascal-to-pascal conversion factor of the layer midpoint pressure: pmid = 100 p, the inverse of the parcel working pressure p = 0.01 pmid (zm_convr.F90:518); the named ×100 unit-conversion constant of the Parcel.p → Evap.pmid coupling edge"
    },
    "density_fresh_water": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "description": "fresh-water density, the /1000 of the m/s conversion of zm_convr.F90:779 (the same SHR_CONST_RHOFW constant the Evap component uses at zm_conv_evap.F90:234-236), [kg/m3]; wired from the Evap component's density_fresh_water (the single source of the constant)"
    },
    "z_sfc": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "dummy lower bound of the whole-column integral rule (the prec budget integrates over the layer pressure measure; the rule's z_sfc/z_top bounds carry no weight)"
    },
    "z_top": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "dummy upper bound of the whole-column integral rule (see z_sfc)"
    },
    "dz": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "layer pressure measure of the prec budget integral: dz = pdel per level (the Fortran dpp layer weight of the prec loop, zm_convr.F90:772-774), [Pa]"
    },
    "prec_integrand": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/(kg*s)",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "prec budget integrand dqdt + dlf, the per-level rate whose pressure integral is the water-vapor-minus-detrained-cloudwater change of zm_convr.F90:771-774 (q - qh = delt dqdt), [kg/kg/s]"
    },
    "prec_accum": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa/s",
     "description": "prec budget column integral: integral over lev of prec_integrand over the layer pressure measure dz = pdel, the Fortran accumulated prec of zm_convr.F90:772-774 before the rgrav conversion, [Pa/s]"
    },
    "prec": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "precipitation rate out of zm_convr_run: prec = max(0, -prec_accum) rgrav / density_fresh_water (zm_convr.F90:779: prec = rgrav max(prec, 0)/delt/1000 with the accumulated delt factored out of dqdt), [m/s]; dump column prec_convr; the precip-flux coupling into the Evap component"
    },
    "t1": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "evap entry temperature t1 = t + delt dsdt, the physics_update of zm_conv_intr.F90:640 (state1%t = state%t + ztodt ptend%s/cp with ptend%s = dsdt cp), [K]; dump column t1"
    },
    "q1": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "shape": [
      "lev"
     ],
     "description": "evap entry specific humidity q1 = q + delt dqdt, the physics_update of zm_conv_intr.F90:640 (state1%q = state%q + ztodt dqdt; the q update is also applied inside zm_convr_run at zm_convr.F90:751-754), [kg/kg]; dump column q1"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "dz",
     "rhs": "pdel"
    },
    {
     "lhs": "prec_integrand",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       "dqdt",
       "dlf"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "prec_accum",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "integral",
      "args": [
       "prec_integrand"
      ],
      "var": "lev",
      "lower": "z_sfc",
      "upper": "z_top"
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "prec",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "max",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 0.0,
        "units": "m/s"
       },
       {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 0.0,
            "units": "Pa/s"
           },
           "prec_accum"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "grav",
           "density_fresh_water"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "t1",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "physics_update_step",
      "bindings": {
       "x": "t0",
       "tend": "dsdt",
       "dt": "delt"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "q1",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "physics_update_step",
      "bindings": {
       "x": "q",
       "tend": "dqdt",
       "dt": "delt"
      }
     }
    }
   ],
   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "s19_g1",
     "description": "End-to-end ZM chain pin for step 19, g = 1 (cam_zm.csv step 19 rows lev 1..32, cam_zm_scal.csv step 19; lel = 15, maxi = mx = maxg = 32, jt = 15, dsubcld = 14.0314 mb): boundary inputs only - the parcel profiles t/q/z/p/pf/tp/qstp/qtot with the parcel-ascent solve outputs carried as parameters (see cam_zm_parcel.esm), the cldprp outputs of the closure (gathered sg, plume states qu/su/qd/sd/qhat/shat/ql, geometry pdel/zf, and the NORMALIZED fluxes mu/md/mc/du = dump/mb, the form the closure receives before the zm_convr_run mb scaling of F90:725-735; the gathered qg/tg/pg/pf_lo/pf_hi come through the gather edges from the parcel profiles), and the evap boundary cldfrc/fsnow_conv/rprd/flxprec_lo/flxsnow_lo with the derived evpvint (the running accumulator of zm_conv_evap.F90:195; pmid comes through the hPa-to-Pa edge from the parcel working pressure) - nothing a mounted component computes is overridden. Pins: Parcel.cape (buoyan_dilute), Closure.mb (the closure formula from the coupled cape), the q1q2 tendencies dqdt/dsdt at the convection top lev 15 (= jt), a deep level lev 25 and the subcloud level lev 32 (= maxg) and dlf at lev 15, Control.prec (the precipitation budget of zm_convr.F90:770-779, prec = max(0, -sum pdel (dqdt + dlf)) rgrav/1000, the coupling-derived pin equal to the dumped prec_convr), Control.t1/q1 at lev 25 (the physics_update of zm_conv_intr.F90:640), the evap tendencies tend_s/tend_q at levs 17 and 25 (the evaporation heating and moistening of zm_conv_evap.F90:228-231, fed the coupled t1/q1/prec) and prec_evap is a roundoff residual of order 1e-22 m/s on this step (the column evaporates its precipitation; the evap component's own tests pin the zero branch at steps 18/22) and is not pinned here.  Tuples extracted and dump-verified by stage1/analysis/extract_cam_zm_assembly_tests.py and materialized by stage1/analysis/inject_cam_zm_assembly_tests.py.",
     "time_span": {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.0
     },
